<title>IRAQ: Iraq TV shows Iraqi accused of spying for CIA.</title>
<headline>Iraq TV shows Iraqi accused of spying for CIA.</headline>
<dateline>BAGHDAD 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iraqi television showed on Friday an Iraqi accused of spying for the U.S. Central Intelligence Agency (CIA).</p>
<p>Saad Daham Awad, 32, an officer in the Iraqi army, wore civilian dress and spoke in a relaxed manner to the television presenter.</p>
</text>
